      "writtenOn": "2018-10-18T08:59:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "(Nit: the boolean might make it easier to stop the thread. If the thread consists of multiple slow operations (e.g., a DNS lookup, followed by another DNS lookup, followed by...) then between each of these slow operations, the code could check the boolean, and return early if the boolean was false.)",
      "parentUuid": "72819bcc_58b9e27c",
